// A function value no binding names is one instance, so arithmetic over its
// calls bounds one result cell `Number & Singleton`, and a later call's settle
// found no witness and refused it as unsatisfiable: `Singleton` refuses the
// set, not its members. Found by the nov06d soak (aieka, mono-reuse).
{ let g = select true { true => |b| never(), false => |b| never() }; let a = g(true) + g(false); let c = g(false); 7 }
